# Static members, out-of-struct member definitions, template deduction through Box<T>, a cbuffer named like its member, wide literal arithmetic.
case lang_statics_and_literals
shader lang/statics_and_literals.hlsl
dispatch CSMain 1 1 1
uniform 0 0 : 1.0 2.0 3.0 4.0 1u 0u 0u 0u  5.0 6.0 7.0 8.0 2u 0u 0u 0u  9.0 10.0 11.0 12.0 3u 0u 0u 0u
storage 0 1 out size=64
